 30 F.R. 8447, which provided rates of charges for hospitalization and dispensary services, was revoked by Ex. Ord. No. 12553, Feb. 25, 1986, 51 F.R. 7237.","quote_truncated":false,"system":"usc","where":"USC 24 U.S.C. 34 note"},"proposal":{"actor":"EO:12553","date":"1986-02-25","mechanism":"revocation","source":{"page_or_item":"24 U.S.C. 34 note; note 'Executive Order No. 11116' [USLM note id idfe8c5871-9d45-11f0-a0db-bff75580f504]; usc24.xml (sha256 ce4cf18ea49e98d8bd901c0871f106a1cfca0c4db8a0fddbe48e13daacaa17bc) in xml_uscAll@119-121.zip","sha256":"c6122974e951003437ece5a998aa7c0b2cdc0f5703dfc78d6135e1fc9e729142","url":"https://uscode.house.gov/download/releasepoints/us/pl/119/121/xml_uscAll@119-121.zip"}},"suggested":false}],"whole_order_end_total":2},"provisional_status":"no","readiness":{"by_step":{"clause_inventory":"confirm","counterevidence":"resolve_conflicts","ending_or_current_basis":"confirm","opus_media":"n/a","original_text":"confirm","savings_residuals":"agent_judgment","shared_sources":"n/a"},"needs_research":[],"would_satisfy_once_confirmed":["original_text","clause_inventory","ending_or_current_basis"]},"shared_sources":[],"signing_dates_seen":{"fr-originals@jobs/fr-originals/output":"1963-08-05","later-events_catalog":"1963-08-05","stage19_causal_queue":"1963-08-05"},"source_ladder_exhausted_proposed":[],"status":"MACHINE DRAFT - UNVERIFIED; not a claim; see jobs/claim-drafts/AGENT_GUIDE.md"},"claim":{"instrument_id":"EO:11116","later_source_search":[],"operative_clauses":[{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S e c t io n 1 .R a tes. Rates of charges for hospitalization and dis­\npensary services are hereby prescribed, under the last sentence of \nSection 4 of the A ct o f May 10,1943, c. 95, 57 Stat. 81 (24 U.S.C. 34), \nand for the purposes o f that section, as follow s:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"28 FR 8075, PDF pages 5-7; Sec. 1 (lead-in)","sha256":"040e985188bf7a7d1a3d48ebd5fee798fb5f76e5be2ba484e5e543a7975918e1","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1963-08-08/pdf/FR-1963-08-08.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11116#sec1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(1 ) Inpatient care, per diem :\n(i) For employees of the United States who are not citizens of\nthe United States and their dependents, $5. 00\n(ii) For all others, 37.00\n(2) Each outpatient treatment, examination, or consultation:\n(i) For employees of the United States and their dependents, 1.0 0\n(ii) For all others, 8. 00\nS ec . 2. Delegation,  (a) Executive Order No. 10530 of May 10, \n1954, headed “ Providing for the performance of certain functions \nvested in or subject to the approval o f the President,” as amended, is \nhereby further amended by adding at the end o f Section 1 thereof \nthe following paragraph:\n“ (w) The authority vested in the President by the last sentence of \nSection 4 o f the Act of May 10, 1943, c. 95, 57 Stat. 81 (24 U.S.C. \n34), to prescribe from time to time rates o f charges for hospitalization \nand dispensary services.”\n(b) The provisions of Section 1 of this order shall be subject to \namendment, supersedure, or revocation, in whole or in part and at \nany time or times after the effective date o f this order, under authority \no f Section l(w)  o f Executive Order No. 10530 (as added by Section \n2 (a) o f this order).","original_source":{"page_or_item":"28 FR 8075, PDF pages 5-7; Sec. 1(1)","sha256":"040e985188bf7a7d1a3d48ebd5fee798fb5f76e5be2ba484e5e543a7975918e1","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1963-08-08/pdf/FR-1963-08-08.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11116#sec1(1)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S ec . 3. Revocation.  Executive Order No. 9411 o f December 23, \n1943, is hereby revoked.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"28 FR 8075, PDF pages 5-7; Sec. 3","sha256":"040e985188bf7a7d1